<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on</p>
<p>the first day of four day Red Stripe Cup matches played Friday:</p>
<p>In St John's: Leewards Islands 224-5 (Dave Joseph 66) v</p>
<p>Trinidad and Tobago.</p>
<p>In Georgetown: Guyana v Jamaica no play - rain.</p>
<p>Scores unavailable in thge match between Windward Islands</p>
<p>and Barbados in Grenada.</p>
</text>
